{"413470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Untold Mystery: Angel's Cry 2 - Tears of the Fallen", "steam_appid": 413470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413470/extras/6582737f97300534bb5f514955dbe9eb.avif?t=1762945901\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inquisitor Augustine has lost his mind, plunging Portonero into fear. You must step in, investigate suspicious villagers, uncover the truth behind the chaos and end the reign of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the obsessive inquisitor Augustine, discover hidden clues in Portonero, and solve hundreds of puzzles to bring peace back to the terrified villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413470/extras/0b3d6b81c78fc76771061aed8fa0a724.avif?t=1762945901\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- BONUS CHAPTER &quot;Mark My Words!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- re-playable MINI-GAMES  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- re-playable HIDDEN OBJECT scenes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ART BOOK and SOUNDTRACK </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- complete integrated STRATEGY GUIDE  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413470/extras/e2765eafb219bf93f1a5652e4673a587.avif?t=1762945901\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure – investigate  scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Dozens of locations &amp; mini-games – mystery lurks from every dark corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Map &amp; Journal – always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals – immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ 3 difficulty levels – from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📴 Play completely offline — anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 No data collection — your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck — but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge: Casual, Adventure, and Challenging difficulty modes. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413470/extras/6582737f97300534bb5f514955dbe9eb.avif?t=1762945901\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inquisitor Augustine has lost his mind, plunging Portonero into fear. You must step in, investigate suspicious villagers, uncover the truth behind the chaos and end the reign of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the obsessive inquisitor Augustine, discover hidden clues in Portonero, and solve hundreds of puzzles to bring peace back to the terrified villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\